import{_ as i,o as a,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 509 | Origin Acceleration Domain | Unification of the Acceleration Domain With the Reality-as-Base Principle","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 509 | Origin Acceleration Domain | Unification of the Acceleration Domain With the Reality-as-Base Principle","no":509,"module":3,"tags":["Origin Acceleration Domain","Reality-as-Base","Law Upgrading","Causal Anchoring","Avoiding Virtual Loss of Control"],"related":["09-Reality-as-Base Fundamental Stance","87-Only-Knowledge-Returned Principle","83-Observe-First-Then-Limited-Intervention Maxim"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0509_模块3-加速域与现实为基统一.md","filePath":"en/0509_模块3-加速域与现实为基统一.md"}'),o={name:"en/0509_模块3-加速域与现实为基统一.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,h,u){return a(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-509-origin-acceleration-domain-unification-of-the-acceleration-domain-with-the-reality-as-base-principle" tabindex="-1">Entry 509 | Origin Acceleration Domain | Unification of the Acceleration Domain With the Reality-as-Base Principle <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-509-origin-acceleration-domain-unification-of-the-acceleration-domain-with-the-reality-as-base-principle" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 509 | Origin Acceleration Domain | Unification of the Acceleration Domain With the Reality-as-Base Principle&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 09, 87, 83</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-acceleration-is-not-an-excuse-to-detach-from-reality" tabindex="-1">Introduction: acceleration is not an excuse to detach from reality <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-acceleration-is-not-an-excuse-to-detach-from-reality" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: acceleration is not an excuse to detach from reality&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Any &quot;accelerated cultivation&quot; design, if pushed too far, will meet a philosophical trap: <strong>if the world in consciousness is so fast it detaches from reality, is the cultivator already living in a dream?</strong> The predatory-school system&#39;s answer to this trap is &quot;a strong one can crush reality even in a dream,&quot; so the more cultivated the more illusory, finally even the author cannot make it round. Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s answer is completely different — it wrote &quot;reality-as-base&quot; into the Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s underlying code. Six top-level axioms stand out here: anti-predation axiom does not allow the Acceleration Domain to become a lawless place detached from reality; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the Acceleration Domain serve the Myriad Ranks in reality; collective ascension axiom requires the Acceleration Domain&#39;s fruits must return to reality; causal self-discipline axiom requires observe first, then limited intervention, only knowledge returned; law-first axiom requires the rule &quot;reality-as-base&quot; itself stable and unchanging. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This article argues: how the Origin Acceleration Domain is engineering-unified with &quot;reality-as-base.&quot;</p><h2 id="i-three-iron-laws" tabindex="-1">I. Three Iron Laws <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-iron-laws" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three Iron Laws&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain in design has three iron laws that cannot be crossed:</p><ol><li><strong>Energy must come from real increment</strong>: law-resonance energy consumed by the Acceleration Domain&#39;s operation must come from the symbiotic network&#39;s increment developed on the real plane; no &quot;creating from nothing&quot; inside the Acceleration Domain;</li><li><strong>Knowledge must return to reality for validation</strong>: any scheme deduced in the Acceleration Domain must pass minimal experimental validation in reality (or isolated space) before application;</li><li><strong>Causality must anchor to reality</strong>: all deduction in the Acceleration Domain may not directly rewrite real causality; may only return in the form of &quot;knowledge,&quot; and must undergo information purification.</li></ol><p>Three iron laws combined is Document 09&#39;s &quot;reality-as-base, law-upgrading&quot; principle&#39;s complete projection in the time domain.</p><h2 id="ii-why-the-acceleration-domain-is-not-a-dream" tabindex="-1">II. Why the Acceleration Domain Is Not a &quot;Dream&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-the-acceleration-domain-is-not-a-dream" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why the Acceleration Domain Is Not a &quot;Dream&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Some worry: living a hundred years at hundredfold flow, what is the difference from living a hundred years in a dream? The answer is: <strong>the difference lies in energy source and causal anchor.</strong> A dream is the brain&#39;s self-entertainment, does not consume real energy; the Acceleration Domain is law engineering, every second consuming the symbiotic network&#39;s real energy. After a dream ends, the person returns to reality, brings nothing back; after the Acceleration Domain ends, the cultivator brings back validated real knowledge, this knowledge in reality will change real engineering, save real lives, repair real laws.</p><p>In other words, the Acceleration Domain is not &quot;fake&quot;; it is &quot;the strictly constrained real.&quot; It is an efficient copy of reality, not a substitute for reality.</p><h2 id="iii-comparison-with-reality-escape-type-acceleration" tabindex="-1">III. Comparison With &quot;Reality-Escape Type&quot; Acceleration <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-comparison-with-reality-escape-type-acceleration" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Comparison With &quot;Reality-Escape Type&quot; Acceleration&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Old Myriad-Realms systems have a class of acceleration setting: the protagonist enters a small world to cultivate a hundred years, comes out power-soaring, but social relations, responsibilities, causality in reality are all &quot;fast-forwarded&quot; away. This design is essentially reality escape — pulling the cultivator out of reality, throwing him into a weightless vacuum. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Acceleration Domain is the opposite: the cultivator&#39;s family, duties, social relations all remain in reality; every bit of output he produces in the Acceleration Domain must explain &quot;what use is this to the Myriad Ranks in reality.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-engineering-implementation-of-the-causal-self-discipline-axiom" tabindex="-1">IV. Engineering Implementation of the Causal Self-Discipline Axiom <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-engineering-implementation-of-the-causal-self-discipline-axiom" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Engineering Implementation of the Causal Self-Discipline Axiom&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Document 83&#39;s &quot;observe first then limited intervention&quot; and Document 87&#39;s &quot;only knowledge returned,&quot; in the Origin Acceleration Domain are concretized as:</p><ul><li>Before entering the Acceleration Domain, first complete a pure observation phase on the task object;</li><li>Inside the Acceleration Domain only do deduction and simulation, do not directly interfere with reality;</li><li>When exiting the Acceleration Domain, only return abstract knowledge, do not return any matter, energy, or life-form;</li><li>Any &quot;looks problematic&quot; scheme first placed in the Quest Sediment Domain for slow stress test (see Entry 515), then decided whether to return to reality.</li></ul><h2 id="v-reality-as-base-s-extension-in-the-cross-plane-era" tabindex="-1">V. Reality-as-Base&#39;s Extension in the Cross-Plane Era <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-reality-as-base-s-extension-in-the-cross-plane-era" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Reality-as-Base&#39;s Extension in the Cross-Plane Era&quot;">​</a></h2><p>With the unfolding of the cross-plane exploration era (Document 78), the meaning of &quot;reality-as-base&quot; is also extending: Heng Yuan Zhou defines &quot;reality&quot; as the real plane covered by the entire symbiotic network, not some Earth copy. All deduction in the Acceleration Domain must ultimately answer to this generalized reality — a scheme proven feasible in the Acceleration Domain, if promoted to other planes and causes destruction, then no matter how perfect it is in isolated space, it counts as failure. This extension makes reality-as-base no longer an Earth-centric slogan, but the unified verification standard of the cross-plane era.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: energy must come from real increment; eliminates internal Acceleration-Domain &quot;creating from nothing&quot; waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: do not turn the Acceleration Domain into a predation training ground detached from real causality</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s protagonist uses a small world to fast-forward and evade real responsibility; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s cultivator is bound to reality by iron laws</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: all Acceleration-Domain output faces the Myriad Ranks in reality, not one person&#39;s private breakthrough</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: three iron laws, information-purification process, reality-validation standards all public; supports cross-plane, cross-dimension unified access</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Fast is not to escape reality; fast is to better return to reality. The Origin Acceleration Domain turns &quot;reality-as-base&quot; from a philosophical slogan into an engineering iron law, letting hundredfold, thousandfold consciousness acceleration always anchor on the real cosmos. This is its fundamental divide from all &quot;dream-type cultivation&quot; designs.</p><p>In the final analysis, the unification of the acceleration domain with reality-as-base described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./09-现实为基根本立场.html">09-Reality-as-Base Fundamental Stance</a> · <a href="./87-仅回传知识原则.html">87-Only-Knowledge-Returned Principle</a> · <a href="./83-先观测后有限干涉准则.html">83-Observe-First-Then-Limited-Intervention Maxim</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const p=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
